  {
   "section": "lp-steps",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "How it actually works"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "It learns your taste. Here's how."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Not a preset menu, and not a guess. The Atelier works the way a good barista does — it pays attention, remembers, and adjusts. Four quiet steps, running every morning."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "1"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "It tastes every cup"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Sensors read the grind, the flow, the strength and the temperature of every pour — the same things a barista would notice."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "2"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "It builds your flavour DNA"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Those readings become a profile for each person in the house, refined a little more with every cup you pour."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "3"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "It reads the morning"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "The time, your calendar, the weather, and who's awake all shape what it suggests — before you've asked for anything."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "4"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "It acts on its own"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "It warms up before your alarm, adjusts the pour to match, and reorders beans before you run low. You just lift the cup."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 15,
     "text": "Your flavour DNA and morning routines stay on your machine and your account. You can review what it has learned, correct it, or wipe it clean, any time."
    }
   ],
